{"resourceIdentifier":"4830","resourceName":"Liaoning Sengda Waste Plastic Recycling Project","description":"“Liaoning Sengda Waste Plastic Recycling Project” (hereinafter called “the Project”) aims to produce the PET flakes by using waste PET products (like consumed package and bottled drink, used cable, etc.) and to replace the same product produced from the raw materials. The total production capacity is about 90,420 tons of post-consumer bottles per year. The Project located in Liaoyang County, Liaoyang City, Liaoning Province, China and is developed and operated by Liaoning Sengda Environmental Resources Group Co., Ltd. (hereinafter called “the Project Owner”).\r\nPrior to the project implementation, the same amount of PET flakes would be produced from raw materials (crude oil and natural gas) which is also the baseline scenario of the project. Therefore, the GHG emission reduction will be generated through the implementation of the project by avoiding the consumption of the equivalent raw materials and reducing related energy consumption as well.\r\nThe estimated annual average GHG emission reduction is 53,657 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":41.210003,"longitude":123.119656},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-03-12","endExclusive":"2024-04-12","endInclusive":"2024-04-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4830"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning Sengda Environmental Resources Group Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 0419-7777666"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4830"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"54031"}